{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34441","headline":"和袭美冬晓章上人院 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美冬晓章上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山寒偏是晓来多，况值禅窗雪气和。\n病客功夫经未演，故人书信纳新磨。\n闲临静案修茶品，独傍深溪记药科。\n从此逍遥知有地，更乘清月伴君过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}